(To the guy who asked about the endgame level)
The solution to the endgame level is extremely simple. 
First, use magic mapping scroll to map the level. You
will see three altars to the west. Teleport to the right
altar and #offer the Amulet Of Yendor to your god. That's all
and you will ascend to the rank of demi-god, and, of course,
complete the game. 
I was a bit disappointed.. endgame was TOO easy. ;-)


